              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14'>INFO:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>*Note: Select the acquisition dates to see post 30D Revenue from those acquisitions. For accurate revenue reporting, 30 day window should be complete.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>** Report is not real time, the latest available end date is 20th last month, every month after 20th, we update the previous month&apos;s first 20 days since it is a complete cohort (e.g. On March 21st, we added acquisitions and their revenue up until Feb 20th).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto' fontsize='10'>***</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Platform is the actual platform where the acquisition/order happened, not the targeted one. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Country Specific :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>** For Non-PM we are excluding all channels that have costs but no acquisitions. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>** Pm and Non-PM acquisitions are calculated with 7-day attribution window, while Country acquisitions do not contain any acquisition window.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='29851' id='343' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery_Hero_Trading_Update_Q12022-custom-cover.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='49475' x='50031' y='39552'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='274' h='29726' id='373' is-fixed='true' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99012' x='494' y='69403'>
            <zone fixed-size='748' forceUpdate='true' h='29726' id='337' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='49537' x='494' y='69403'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14'>Metric Definitions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- CPA: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Performance Marketing cost divided by monthly Acquisitions cal.iOSFix</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- Revenue 30D/90D/180D : </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>actual Revenue after 30/90/180 days from the acquisitions</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- GMV 30D/90D/180D : </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>actual GMV after 30/90/180 days from the acquisitions</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- Revenue 30D/ CPA: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>new efficiency metric to report on quality of recent acquisitions and channel efficiency MoM. 30 Day Revenue divided by CPA.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- GMV 30D/ CPA:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> 30 Day GMV divided by CPA</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='29726' id='267' type-v2='text' w='49475' x='50031' y='69403'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>For any comments or feedback related to data and the report.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>Please reach out to our slack channel</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>#mkt_report_alerts</run>
